  "plain": "A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that in the 1990s Laurence Rockefeller, a very wealthy American philanthropist, tried to get Hillary Clinton, then the First Lady, to take UFOs seriously, and that there is a photo of the two of them together. Michels ties this effort to John Mack, a psychiatrist who studied people who said they had been taken by aliens, and to a document called Are We Alone. If true, it would mean UFO disclosure was being pushed at the very top of American politics."
